@startuml UC-53 View Physics Simulation Analysis - Sequence Diagram
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #000000
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
title 2.6.2.3 UC-53 View Physics Simulation Analysis — Sequence Diagram

actor "Physics Teacher" as Teacher
participant ":GenericDetailView" as GDV
participant ":LandmarksPanel" as PANEL
participant ":SceneKonva2D" as CANVAS
participant ":Landmark" as MARK
participant ":SceneKernel" as KERNEL

autonumber
Teacher ->> GDV : Open the Analysis tab of the simulation currently running
activate GDV
GDV ->> PANEL : render()
activate PANEL
PANEL ->> PANEL : lay out the shared time marks t1 to t8 that every simulation supports
PANEL ->> MARK : values(params)
activate MARK
MARK -->> PANEL : LandmarkValue list
PANEL ->> MARK : atTime(params)
MARK -->> PANEL : second at which the state occurs
deactivate MARK

alt the opened simulation declares no landmark
  PANEL -->> Teacher : Show only the shared time marks of the current run
else the opened simulation declares landmarks
  PANEL -->> Teacher : Show each landmark with its letter, description and calculated values with units
end
deactivate PANEL

Teacher ->> PANEL : Select a time mark or the "Go to" button of a landmark
activate PANEL
PANEL ->> GDV : jumpTo(mark)
deactivate PANEL
GDV ->> GDV : keep the mark just left as a dashed ghost and raise the seek token
GDV ->> CANVAS : render()
activate CANVAS
CANVAS ->> KERNEL : project(initialState)
activate KERNEL
KERNEL -->> CANVAS : StateVec
CANVAS ->> KERNEL : derivs(s)
KERNEL -->> CANVAS : StateVec
deactivate KERNEL
CANVAS ->> CANVAS : integrate from the initial state to the requested second at a fixed sub-step, then stop the run
CANVAS ->> GDV : handleReadout(readout)
CANVAS -->> Teacher : Show the run stopped at the mark with its label and the dashed ghost of the previous mark
deactivate CANVAS
GDV -->> Teacher : Show the time, position, velocity and kinetic and potential energy calculated for that state

opt teacher changes a parameter while the Analysis tab is open
  Teacher ->> GDV : Change a supported parameter of the simulation
  GDV ->> PANEL : render()
  activate PANEL
  PANEL ->> MARK : values(params)
  activate MARK
  MARK -->> PANEL : LandmarkValue list recalculated for the new inputs
  deactivate MARK
  PANEL -->> Teacher : Refresh the landmark values and the second of each mark
  deactivate PANEL
end
deactivate GDV
@enduml
